{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"374"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ぐるぐるカーテン」を聞いた感想は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ぐるぐるカーテン」は乃木坂46らしい曲だと思う!メロディは落ち着いてて、かわいらしくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞はおんなのこおんなのこしてる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校生活がテーマなんだよね。等身大な感じが好きですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治手作りチョコレートのTVＣＭソングですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"375"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこ見たけどカップリング曲に衝撃受けたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて聴いた時どうだった？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"376"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビューシングルのカップリング曲の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会いたかったかもしれない」を聴いてどう思った?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会いたかった」ははひめたんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46スターティングメンバーオーディションの時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌って踊った曲なのー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出深いし、未だによく歌うし、大好きな曲です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから「会いたかったかもしれない」聴いた時はめっちゃびっくりしたー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会いたかった」はもちろん好きだけど、でも「会いたかったかもしれない」も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人に愛されたらいいなって思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...歌いたかったかもしれない('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"377"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょんが\"ぐるぐるカーテン♪\"というタイトルだけを聞いた時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ではどう思ったか、エピソードがあったら教えて欲しいな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「え？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなりますよね最初は。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかめっちゃ単純だしーって思った(^^)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)は「この曲、これからぐるカーとか呼ばれるんだろうな(ω)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言っとった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるカー。可愛いぢゃん(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"378"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコが好きなら、今回の明治とのタイアップはめっちゃ嬉しいのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃーめーちゃ嬉しいですよ(ω)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、ろってぃー(川村真洋chan)すごいんよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の最終オーデの自己PRで自分の夢を語った中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いつかチョコレートのＣＭに出ることが夢です!」って言っとったんよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんはドキッとしたらしいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"378"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん今年のバレンタインは何作る予定?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのオススメは２色のマカロンです(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもマカロン作ったことあるけど、ちょい難しいんよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも挑戦してみて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デコチョコは簡単で美味しいよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デコデコ〜♪←ひなちま（樋口日奈chan）の真似(∀)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"308"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはバレンタインにチョコを渡す予定はあるのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんもちろん明治ミルチで手作りしますよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...だけど乃木坂のみんな美意識が強いからなー受け取ってくれるか心配('ω`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の子はみんな受験生モード全快ぢゃけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気ぶち壊して明治のミルチ配ってきます(`・・)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"381"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんみたいな妹が欲しいです(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちの妹になってください!←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのお姉ちゃんになってくれるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんだよお姉ちゃんっ∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"382"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、元気になって良かったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなお疲れ、みたいだけど大丈夫なの???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大変そう('`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんなと会うことで元気いっぱいになるんだろうから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張らんにゃね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずこの前で一段落ついた感はありますね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"383お母さんの愛情たっぷりの料理で育ったひめたんは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京でなに食べているのですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日による。ほんとーうに日による。気分によります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京はご飯も美味しいからねー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと気を使ってるつもりですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"384"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいた時、中元家ではどうするの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島独特の治し方が、あるんでしょうか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやそんなことないですよ(-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体をあっためて、あとはあっさり自然治癒に任せよう!って感じです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんめったに風邪引かないもんなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"320"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンという名のお兄ちゃん?も乃木坂入れて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぇるかんむ(o>ω<o)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"321"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/2595812/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、コメントできるのにサボってるふぁむに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か言いたいことありますか?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーん寂しーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントサボったらひめたん悲しいじゃないですかー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんブログサボってもいいのー(>_<)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...とかゆって。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}